  "Question": "In parallelogram \\(ABCD\\), \\(AB=5\\) and \\(BC=8\\). The bisector \\(AE\\) of \\(\\angle BAD\\) intersects side \\(BC\\) at point \\(E\\). Find the length of \\(EC\\).",
