  "Correct Answer": "3",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Since \\(AD\\parallel BC\\), \\(\\angle DAE=\\angle AEB\\). Also, \\(\\angle BAE=\\angle DAE\\), so \\(\\angle BAE=\\angle AEB\\). Thus, \\(BE=AB=5\\), and \\(EC=8-5=3\\).",
